1792430581.673	AFS power test firmware - press any key within 2 s for the console
1792430581.686	commands:
1792430581.686	  show                    print configuration
1792430581.697	  set <key> <value>       keys: sleep fill settle measure drain dry gnss reg move
1792430581.697	                          ncycles cpu modem gnssen force apn host port path
1792430581.708	  cycle                   run one full cycle now, stay awake
1792430581.708	  auto                    cycle -> deep sleep(sleep) -> cycle ... (ncycles, 0=forever)
1792430581.719	  step <name>             hold one subsystem on until any key
1792430581.719	  sleep <s>               deep sleep for s seconds, then back to this console
1792430581.730	  modem on|off            power the SIM7000G up/down
1792430581.731	  at <command>            send a raw AT command
1792430581.741	  echo on|off             show AT traffic
1792430581.741	  vbat                    battery and solar voltage
1792430581.742	  read [n]                print all analog inputs n times (1 s apart)
